<DataEntry>You can change the ModType of a particular UE source and DigitalDemod sink from 16QAM to Star 16QAM and observe the constellation change.&#x000D;&#x000A;This can be used to prove that the intended Rx is receiving the right Tx signal.</DataEntry>
