<Item XName="Text" Type="Param">
<DataEntry>Multi-channel phase shifter, for 64 channels of each UE stream&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;By default,&#x000D;&#x000A;phases1 for UE1&#x000D;&#x000A;phases2 for UE2&#x000D;&#x000A;phases3 for UE3&#x000D;&#x000A;phases4 for UE4&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;You can enable Tx Beamformers below and dynamically tune the Tx beam directions.</DataEntry>
